  "recapNotes": [
    "Quarterbacks coach Aiden Upchurch said before kickoff that execution, not emotion, would decide the district opener against a Tomball team the Hurricanes respected. \"Our key to victory tonight will be our level of execution,\" Upchurch said. Cain followed that script.",
